{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Join_the_family_fight!.png?t=1748873616\" />Pick your character and step into Amer\u2019s world where the fights hit harder than your mom\u2019s slipper and the drama feels like a family WhatsApp group gone wrong. No floppy animals or jelly bodies here, just families settling scores, uncles jumping in for no reason, and chaos that actually makes sense to us. Whether you're teaming up or turning on each other like always, expect wild twists, loud laughs, and pure Arab-style madness in the party fighting game<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_7.gif?t=1748873616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_4.gif?t=1748873616\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/avoid.png?t=1748873616\" />Settle family fights by teaming up with your family and friends and becoming the real gang. No floppy moves or slow chaos here, just fast fun, surprises, and enough drama to keep things interesting. Take the lead and remind everyone who\u2019s really the boss of the family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_1.gif?t=1748873616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_5.gif?t=1748873616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Choose_your_map.png?t=1748873616\" />Get ready for the ultimate family fighting game! Choose from a variety of exciting maps, each with its own unique theme and challenges, for an unforgettable experience filled with fun, chaos, and friendly competition for everyone to enjoy.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_3.gif?t=1748873616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/No_gang__no_beasts__just_family!.png?t=1748873616\" />Forget those clumsy games where characters flop around like they don\u2019t know what\u2019s going on. Here you set the traps, catch people slipping, and make moves that actually matter. Outsmart the rest, sit back, and claim your win like it\u2019s just another family roast session.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_2.gif?t=1748873616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264920?t=1748873616","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748873616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/344013a643ca0e7ddf02c6ae42a52037e03519a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748873616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/344013a643ca0e7ddf02c6ae42a52037e03519a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748873616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"descripti